                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The favourable association of LGBTI people and/or LGBTI rights with a nationalist ideology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "neologism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15d58c3a-112d-4ffd-86a9-49590a378985",
                                                "sense_id": "a0b3cf2c-ae61-3e82-979f-c96d0f07fbc1",
                                                "text": "There is a vicious circle of escalating antagonism between the new homonationalism of LGBTQI communities and what can by analogy be called “heteronationalism”: the adoption of anti-LGBTQI attitudes as an expression of insurgent national, ethnic and/or religious identity."
